## Stack
- React 19, TypeScript (strict), Vite, Biome, Vitest, Tailwind CSS, Zod 4

## Conventions
- Feature-based folder structure: `src/features/<name>/{components,hooks,schemas,__tests__}/`
- Types in `.ts` files only, never `.d.ts` for application types
- Zod schemas as source of truth for types via `z.infer`
- `safeParse` in UI code, never `parse`
- Return types on exported functions
- `as const` for config/route objects
- Discriminated unions for state modeling
- Error hierarchy: `AppError` > `ValidationError` | `RuntimeError`
- Test behavior with RTL + userEvent, not implementation details

## Quality Commands
- `{{ cookiecutter.node_package_manager }} run typecheck` — tsc --noEmit
- `{{ cookiecutter.node_package_manager }} run lint` — biome check
- `{{ cookiecutter.node_package_manager }} run test` — vitest run
- `{{ cookiecutter.node_package_manager }} run check` — full quality gate

